    "path": "Analysis/FunctionSpaces/LebesgueSpaces",
    "placement_strength": "EDITORIAL_NAVIGATION_STATIC_ONLY",
    "rationale": "The source has three actual mechanisms: a full-line complex L² translation isometry and continuity, a half-line zero-extension MemLp lemma, and a fixed-kernel-weighted L²-valued Bochner integral with its norm bound. The weighted component uses the translation component; the extension lemma is independent. These are Lebesgue-space and vector-integration facts, with no constructed half-line convolution operator or self-adjoint/spectral/RH conclusion. The exact legacy dependency variant remains unresolved."
  },
